OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife                
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening 
OL,6,Fwill be dry with some frost and fog    
OL,7,Fpatches. Then it will stay dry for the 
OL,8,Frest of the night but clouding over    
OL,9,Flater.                                 
OL,11,CSaturday:FAfter a dry start cloud will 
OL,12,Fthicken with occasional light rain in  
OL,13,Fthe morning, likely to turn heavier in 
OL,14,Fthe afternoon, western Tayside perhaps 
OL,15,Fholding on to drier conditions.        
OL,17,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FBright  
OL,18,Fspells and a few showers on Sunday.    
OL,19,FMild and windy with rain on Monday in  
OL,20,Fthe west, mostly dry in the east.      
OL,21,FMainly dry and bright on Tuesday.      
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
